# Subagent model selection

When dispatching any Task/subagent in this project:

- Set `model` to **`inherit`**, or omit `model` so it inherits the parent session.
- Do **not** pick alternate slugs (`gpt-*`, `composer-*`, `claude-*`, `cursor-grok-*`, etc.) unless the human explicitly asks for that model in the same message.

Goal: subagents always run on **Auto** / the model selected in the main chat, not a different model chosen by the agent.
